/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 112 0 R
/T (We combined mor than 3 years of Capital Bikeshare trip data with NOAA weather records and station-level detail into a single Power BI model.  After cleaning millions of rows of ridership data and reconciling two different weather file formats.  The analysis surfaced a clear driver of demand merged with Weather impakt. Then Found a striking anomaly of over 1.6 million same-station round trips and produced a validated 2026 ridership forecast that we tested directly against actual results. )
/E (We combined mor than 3 years of Capital Bikeshare trip data with NOAA weather records and station-level detail into a single Power BI model.  After cleaning millions of rows of ridership data and reconciling two different weather file formats.  The analysis surfaced a clear driver of demand merged with Weather impakt. Then Found a striking anomaly of over 1.6 million same-station round trips and produced a validated 2026 ridership forecast that we tested directly against actual results. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [0]
