<<
/Title (We combined mor than 3 years of Capital Bikeshare trip data with NOAA weather records and station-level detail into a single Power BI model.  After cleaning millions of rows of ridership data and reconciling two different weather file formats.  The analysis surfaced a clear driver of demand merged with Weather impakt. Then Found a striking anomaly of over 1.6 million same-station round trips and produced a validated 2026 ridership forecast that we tested directly against actual results.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 391 0 R
/Next 479 0 R
>>
